    return

### Writes `The path is a directory, and this works on a file.`
### :typeparam TWriter: The type of the Writer.
### :param out: The Writer the message goes to.
routine IsADirectoryError.message_into[TWriter](out: @TWriter) -> None
needs TWriter: typename, Writer[TWriter]
