### Writes `The paths are on two partitions, which a rename can't cross: copy, then delete.`
### :typeparam TWriter: The type of the Writer.
### :param out: The Writer the message goes to.
routine CrossDeviceError.message_into[TWriter](out: @TWriter) -> None
needs TWriter: typename, Writer[TWriter]
